WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:04.320
Roxy called Terrell. He didn't answer.

2
00:00:04.321 --> 00:00:05.949
She left a message.

3
00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:08.358
"I'm sorry about yesterday, Terrell.

4
00:00:08.359 --> 00:00:10.849
Congratulations on your award!"

5
00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:17.349
She hung up. "I hope he's not mad at me."

6
00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:21.108
"Let me out!" Terrell banged on the door.

7
00:00:21.109 --> 00:00:25.149
"Tell us who Rocket Girl is!" Buster yelled.

8
00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:32.731
"I don't know who she is!" Terrell shouted.

9
00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:36.056
He sat down and sighed.

10
00:00:36.057 --> 00:00:39.140
"Roxy was right to be suspicious.

11
00:00:39.141 --> 00:00:41.152
I wish I could call her.

12
00:00:41.153 --> 00:00:44.721
But those guys took my phone."

13
00:00:44.722 --> 00:00:46.939
Someone knocked on the front door.

14
00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:48.863
Buster put on a baseball cap.

15
00:00:48.864 --> 00:00:56.053
Carl put on a football shirt and opened the door.

16
00:00:56.054 --> 00:00:57.917
A kid stood outside.

17
00:00:57.918 --> 00:01:01.421
"Hi! I'm here for the Metro City Sports Club!"

18
00:01:01.422 --> 00:01:05.205
Buster smiled. "Come in, Finn!"

19
00:01:05.206 --> 00:01:08.699
"Thanks!" Finn said.

20
00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:11.763
"I'm excited for my football award!"

21
00:01:11.764 --> 00:01:15.527
"Do you know Rocket Girl?" Carl asked.

22
00:01:15.528 --> 00:01:19.205
Finn scratched his head. "Um, no."

23
00:01:19.206 --> 00:01:23.603
"You did the Rocket Girl Dance Challenge!" Buster said.

24
00:01:23.604 --> 00:01:27.682
"You must know her! Tell us who she is!"

25
00:01:27.683 --> 00:01:30.891
"I don't know her!" Finn said.

26
00:01:30.892 --> 00:01:34.046
"You're not leaving until you tell us!"

27
00:01:34.047 --> 00:01:36.256
Buster brought Finn upstairs.

28
00:01:36.257 --> 00:01:39.771
He pushed him into the room.

29
00:01:39.772 --> 00:01:41.923
The door slammed shut.

30
00:01:41.924 --> 00:01:46.480
"Finn!" Terrell said. "What are you doing here?"

31
00:01:46.481 --> 00:01:51.177
Finn sighed. "I thought I was winning an award.

32
00:01:51.178 --> 00:01:54.264
Those guys said they were the Metro City Sports Club.

33
00:01:54.265 --> 00:01:56.263
But they tricked me!

34
00:01:56.264 --> 00:01:58.945
They think I know who Rocket Girl is."

35
00:01:58.946 --> 00:02:03.516
"Ugh!" Terrell said. "They tricked me too!"

36
00:02:03.517 --> 00:02:06.399
Roxy left another message for Terrell.

37
00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:09.745
"Who keeps calling Terrell?" Carl asked.

38
00:02:09.746 --> 00:02:12.524
Buster looked at Terrell's phone and shrugged.

39
00:02:12.525 --> 00:02:15.313
"Some girl named Roxy.

40
00:02:15.314 --> 00:02:18.525
She's probably just one of his friends."

41
00:02:18.526 --> 00:02:21.079
Someone knocked on the door.

42
00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:24.422
"Ling is here!" Carl said.

43
00:02:24.423 --> 00:02:27.459
Terrell looked up as the door opened again.

44
00:02:27.460 --> 00:02:30.180
Now Carl was wearing a top hat.

45
00:02:30.181 --> 00:02:32.591
He pushed Ling into the room.

46
00:02:32.592 --> 00:02:35.047
Ling stomped her foot.

47
00:02:35.048 --> 00:02:40.477
"I don't know Rocket Girl!" She sighed.

48
00:02:40.478 --> 00:02:44.951
"Those guys aren't really the Metro City Jazz Dance Club!"

49
00:02:44.952 --> 00:02:47.451
Soon another girl was brought in.

50
00:02:47.452 --> 00:02:49.309
Her name was Emily.

51
00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:51.873
"I thought I was getting an award!

52
00:02:51.874 --> 00:02:55.382
They're not the Metro City Poet's Society!"

53
00:02:55.383 --> 00:03:00.836
"Did you both do the Rocket Girl Dance Challenge?" Terrell asked.

54
00:03:00.837 --> 00:03:02.883
The girls nodded.

55
00:03:02.884 --> 00:03:05.771
"They tricked all of us," Terrell said.

56
00:03:05.772 --> 00:03:07.872
"They won't let us leave."

57
00:03:07.873 --> 00:03:11.441
"This is terrible!" Finn said.

58
00:03:11.442 --> 00:03:15.108
"We're doomed!" Emily said.

59
00:03:15.109 --> 00:03:19.862
"I hope Rocket Girl saves us," Ling said.

60
00:03:19.863 --> 00:03:21.565
Terrell made a fist.

61
00:03:21.566 --> 00:03:23.786
"Rocket Girl doesn't know we're here.

62
00:03:23.787 --> 00:03:26.563
So it's up to us to save ourselves.

63
00:03:26.564 --> 00:03:30.915
We're going to escape!"

